member.example:
The following example shows how to apply Smart Fill for open forms with clipboard content:


<SfSmartPdfViewer @ref="smartPdfViewer">
    <SmartFillSettings />
</SfSmartPdfViewer>

@code {
    public async void SmartFormFill()
    {
        await smartPdfViewer.ApplySmartFillAsync();
    }
}

The following example demonstrates how to invoke Smart Fill with your own data:


<SfSmartPdfViewer @ref="smartPdfViewer" >
    <SmartFillSettings />
</SfSmartPdfViewer>

@code {
    public async void SmartFormFill()
    {
        await smartPdfViewer.ApplySmartFillAsync("FirstName: Alice; LastName: Smith; Email: allice@domain.com;");
    }
}

The following example demonstrates how to configure custom redaction patterns for detecting social security and credit card numbers:


<SfSmartPdfViewer>
    <SmartRedactSettings RedactPatterns="@redactPatterns" />
</SfSmartPdfViewer>

@code {
string[] redactPatterns = New string[] {  &quot;SSN&quot;, &quot;Credit Card&quot;};
}
